      "writtenOn": "2026-10-23T21:19:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack - I agree that eliminating `interrupt_disable_all()` makes this much cleaner.  The original justification for using `cpsid i` appears to have been made in error and wasn\u0027t made to fix an actual problem.",
